     "applies up to four specifications in sequence."}], "Usage"],
  Cell["Details", "NotesSection"], Cell["This older routine uses energy, \
momentum magnitude, masses and auxiliary Zeta spinors. The source describes \
it as implemented only to linear order, so do not treat it as a universal \
exact massive-to-massless replacement.", "Notes"],
  Cell["Use ChooseSpinIndex and ExtractEnergy for explicit physical spin \
components without relying on this expansion.", "Notes"],
  Cell["Examples", "PrimaryExamplesSection"],
  Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell["Load HEPCAT", "ExampleSubsection"],
     Cell["Evaluate this setup once before the examples. The paths refer to \
the local HEPCAT checkout; no model parameters are assigned global numerical \
values.", "ExampleText"], Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"If", "[", "!", "StringQ",
         "[", "Global`$HEPCATpath", "]", " ", "||", " ", "!", "DirectoryQ",
         "[", "Global`$HEPCATpath", "]", ",", "\n", " ", " ",
